      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Use WASD to Move, Use SPACE to JUMP, Use E to interact,

    Use Q to
    open Deck Customization, Run into enemies to Battle Them!

    Battles are Fast
    paced battles where you must dodge the enemy attacks at the same time as playing
    cards! In Battle:

    Use LeftClick to select cards in order, Use E to Cast
    Attack Chain, Use space to jump, Hold S to Parry, Double Tap A or D to Dash in
    that Direction!

    Move Around the enemy to collect Energy Orbs and get full
    Energy when Successfuly dodging an Attack!

    You must Explore the World to
    find all of its Great Runes guarded by 5 Great Enemies, All so you Take the Starting
    Portal and beat the Radiant Soul!

'
